@page "/guide"

<PageTitle>Pattern guide</PageTitle>

<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Manage / reference</p><h1>How the examples work</h1></div></div>
<section class="guide-grid">
    <article><span>01</span><h2>Database first</h2><p>SQLite is seeded at startup. Pages query EF Core rather than embedding display data in Razor.</p></article>
    <article><span>02</span><h2>Native SVG</h2><p>The hierarchy and scatter charts need no chart package. Values become coordinates, nodes, paths, and circles.</p></article>
    <article><span>03</span><h2>CSS as encoding</h2><p>The heatmap computes HSL hue from a normalized score and supplies it through CSS custom properties.</p></article>
    <article><span>04</span><h2>Component state</h2><p>Interactive Server components keep selection, expansion, and editor state while database services stay isolated.</p></article>
</section>